MMMMM----- Recipe via Meal-Master (from JavaRecipes)

      Title: Pasta and Kidney Bean Soup (Pasta e Fagioli)
 Categories: Beans
      Yield: 0 Servings

      1  c Kidney beans -- dried - White
      2 tb Extra virgin olive oil
      4  c Chicken stock
    3/4 Pasta -- dried
      6 Parmesan -- grated

Sort the beans and soak them overnight.

Ladle the soup into warmed bowls. Top with cheese.

Notes:
  "Can replace chicken stock with vegetable stock or water.

Very long cook time and prep time."
Yield:
  6 Servings"
S("Cuisine")
  "Italian"

